  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr#PL40.TR.2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL40.TR.2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Vignierio, qui hoc fragmentum ex Divionensi oodicc eruit, imitatorem Augustini sapit, non Augustinum.",
    "chunk_index": 2,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr#PL40.TR.3.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL40.TR.3.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Fructus terrœ benedictœ charitas. Deo adhœrere. Cha­ vitatis fructus reddere.",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr#PL40.TR.3.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL40.TR.3.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Qui Deum non amat, ncc se nec proximum amat. Amor mundi non est umor.",
    "chunk_index": 4,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr#PL40.TR.4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL40.TR.4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Idem est, amate Deum; et , Nolitc diligere mun­ dum.",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr#PL40.TR.5.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL40.TR.5.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Q tis est cnim fructus tuus? Charitas. Si fratrem diligis, terra dedit fructum suum.",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr#PL40.TR.5.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL40.TR.5.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quæ terra ? Utique illa de qua dictum est, Benedixisti, Domine, terram tuam (Psal.",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr#PL40.TR.5.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL40.TR.5.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "LXXXIV, 2). Nain nisi terram tuam bene­ dixisset Deus, produxisset tibi ct alis non fructum, sed spinas et tribulos.",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr#PL40.TR.5.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL40.TR.5.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Hic est fructus terne tusc, quando non bcnedixit Dcus : scd cum benedixit, profers fructum, charitatem.",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr#PL40.TR.5.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL40.TR.5.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Cum ergo nau diligis, sterilis es; habes forsan folia, sed fructibus vacua: quia arboris tuæ fructus, charitas.",
    "chunk_index": 10,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr#PL40.TR.5.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL40.TR.5.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Ecce positus es ut fructum afferas : quis te posuit? Putas tu te ipsum, an is qui dixit, Posui vos ut fructum afferatis (Joan. xv, 16)?",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr#PL40.TR.5.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL40.TR.5.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Si a te ipso positus esses; aut non fructum ferres, aut si ferres, agrestem, nullius saporis, a ne­ mine colligendum, nec in horreo patrisfamilias repo­ nendum.",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr#PL40.TR.5.s8",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL40.TR.5.s8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Vide ergo ut cum te posuerit paterfamilias ut fructum afferas, et a te repoposcerit, ipsi reddas.",
    "chunk_index": 13,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr#PL40.TR.5.s9",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL40.TR.5.s9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Reddes utique suum, non tuum : suum ad quem te posuit, charitatem; tuum, ad quem te posuisti, ma­ hun;",
    "chunk_index": 14,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr#PL40.TR.5.s10",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL40.TR.5.s10",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "quia urbor quam non plantavit Pater, eradicabi­ tur 'Matth. xv, 13). Quare eradicabitur? Quia a se ipsa, non a patrefamilias.",
    "chunk_index": 15,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr#PL40.TR.6.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL40.TR.6.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Dei agricultura es; non tua, non aliorum. Neque arbor se ipsain plantat, ncque se ipsam excolit.",
    "chunk_index": 16,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr#PL40.TR.6.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL40.TR.6.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Sane et Paulus plantat, ct Apollo rigat: sed et quod Pau­ lus plantat nihi! est, et quod Apollo rigat nihil est; sed Deus dal incrementum (I Cor.",
    "chunk_index": 17,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr#PL40.TR.6.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL40.TR.6.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "III, 7); postquam suo nominc plantavit Paulus, aut cum ipso. Sed qui agricola est, idem et vitis : agricola, ut plantet, ut inserat.",
    "chunk_index": 18,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr#PL40.TR.6.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL40.TR.6.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Cui inserat? Utique alienæ arbori? Minime; sibi ipsi ut viti veræ, ut sis et ipse palmes.",
    "chunk_index": 19,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr#PL40.TR.6.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL40.TR.6.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Jam si palmes fucris, quis tibi fructum dabit, nisi vitis illa cujus es palmes?",
    "chunk_index": 20,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr#PL40.TR.6.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL40.TR.6.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Avelle palmitem a vite, quid fiet? Marcescel, steriliscet, morietur : amplius dico, com­ burctur.",
    "chunk_index": 21,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr#PL40.TR.6.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL40.TR.6.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Fratres, vos estis palmites: quamdiu viti adhæseritis, fructum dabitis.",
    "chunk_index": 22,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr#PL40.TR.6.s8",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL40.TR.6.s8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Excidatis semel : quid de vobis net, et quid vobis ultra exspectandum mana­ bit, quam in ignem projici 1 Charitas vitis, charitas palmes.",
    "chunk_index": 23,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr#PL40.TR.6.s9",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL40.TR.6.s9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Vitales succos infundit vitis palmiti ; et idco jure cle palmite fructus reposcit. Quales? Charitatis.",
    "chunk_index": 24,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr#PL40.TR.6.s10",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL40.TR.6.s10",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Charitas dedit, charitas reposcit, redde charitatem; charitatem viti cujus es palmes, charitatem proximo eum 'tuo es palmos.",
    "chunk_index": 25,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr#PL40.TR.6.s11",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL40.TR.6.s11",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Ama Deum, ama proximum. Frustra dico, Ama Deum, ama proximum; nam si Deum diligis, proximum diligis;",
    "chunk_index": 26,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr#PL40.TR.6.s12",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL40.TR.6.s12",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "nec enin potes di­ ligere Dcum, quin diligas proximum. Et sic diligendo Deum, non tantum proximum diligis, sed te ipsum.",
    "chunk_index": 27,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr#PL40.TR.6.s13",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL40.TR.6.s13",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Sed si non diligis Deum, neque proximum diligis, ne­ que te ipsum. Nam quomodo potes amare sine amore?",
    "chunk_index": 28,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr#PL40.TR.6.s14",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL40.TR.6.s14",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Et cujus est annor, nisi boni? Et quid est bonum. nisi Deus, qui ct ipse mandat ut diligamus invicem 9 Quid Deus mandat?",
    "chunk_index": 29,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr#PL40.TR.6.s15",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL40.TR.6.s15",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Ut diligatis. Quid mundus? Ut non diligatis : neque enim diligit, qui, qua mundus mandat ut diligat, diligit.",
    "chunk_index": 30,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr#PL40.TR.6.s16",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL40.TR.6.s16",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Manete in dileciione mea (Joan. xv, 9): non dixit, in dilectione mundi.",
    "chunk_index": 31,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr#PL40.TR.6.s17",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL40.TR.6.s17",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Nesclt mundus amare; artifex est odii. Si mundus vos odit, scitote quia priorem me odio habuit (Ibid. 18).",
    "chunk_index": 32,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr#PL40.TR.7.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-augustinus/pl40_61_tr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL40.TR.7.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Sed quid audio, fratres? Nolite diligere mundum (1 Joan. II, 15). Agnosco vocem, vox cst dilecti et di­ ligentis.",
    "chunk_index": 33,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
